Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5077320,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-5077320","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:23Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5077320,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-5077320","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:45:23Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":5077320,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-5077320","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T16:19:02Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5154670","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1847286114033633","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"update","title":"Update 5: new bodywork","summary":"The physics has worn a tuxedo since day one. The graphics showed up in pajamas, then turned the lights off, and last time finally put on factory paint. Turns out paint doesn't help much when what's underneath is a cardboard box with wheels. The cardboard boxes are finally gone. In the pictures below: old on the left, new on the right. In the demo New models The hatchback, the van and the sedan have new models with a lot more detail. Every car is now exactly as wide as its real counterpart from t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:26:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033633","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:07:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1846651706691365","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest: the starting lights are on","summary":"Steam Next Fest has started, and TapRacer is on the grid. At night, with the headlights on, and for the first time in the right colours. If you haven't tried it yet: TapRacer is a drag racer where your throttle is two keys, tapped in strict alternation. How fast you tap is how far the throttle opens. Underneath sits a real vehicle physics model: torque curves, gear ratios, clutch slip, tire temperature, weight transfer. Tap too timidly at the line and the engine stalls. Too much and the tires go","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691365","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1846651706681556","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"update","title":"Update 4: factory fresh","summary":"Until yesterday every car in TapRacer rolled off the line in the same deep red. The hatchback, the van, the sedan. All red. For a game that reads lamp catalogues from the nineties for its physics, that was embarrassing. Last time the graphics turned the lights off so nobody would notice the pajamas. Now they've actually changed. Into exactly the colours you could order at the dealer. And because that wasn't enough, 289 custom colours for body, wheels and brake calipers are waiting on top. In the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T13:51:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681556","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1846651706673621","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"update","title":"Update 3: lights out, headlights on","summary":"Well, that escalated quickly. A few days ago a Reddit comment asked me to \"tone down the bright grass\". I went looking for the grass and found too much light. Then the night. Then a new colour space. Then headlights for every car. The grass is darker now, by the way. Last time the physics was wearing a tuxedo and the graphics showed up in pajamas. The graphics haven't changed since. They turned the lights off. Works surprisingly well. In the demo Night The quarter mile now lies in the dark, lit ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T08:53:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673621","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1846018067939405","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"update","title":"Update 2: new race track and physics stand 3","summary":"From today the demo races on a new track. With it comes a new physics stand. IN THE DEMO Race Track Update 1The quarter mile is rebuilt: road surface, kerbs, barriers, garages and hills in the background. An arch with the TapRacer lettering stands at the start. Clutch and launchThe clutch no longer snaps shut in one hit; its clamp pressure builds up over a moment. Drop the clutch without gas and you hear only a short, quiet chirp. A stalled car rolls on and comes to a stop, and only then does th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T21:14:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1845383656397672","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"update","title":"Update 1: physics stand 2 — your engine can stall now","summary":"Leaderboards- New physics stand 2 with its own leaderboards. Your old times are still there: the leaderboard lets you page back to stand 1.- If you had already set a time, you're on stand 2 as well — your recorded run was replayed under the new physics and carries the time it actually sets there.Engine and idle- The engine now holds its own idle, with an idle controller and overrun fuel cut — and it can stall. Tap too timidly at the start and you'll see STALLED.- Stop tapping altogether and your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T21:57:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397672","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:40:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5077320-1845383656386191","game_id":"steam-5077320","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out: two keys, a quarter mile","summary":"The free TapRacer demo is live. Hit \"Download Demo\" on the store page and you're on the line.What's in it:- Three cars, from a free starter hatchback to a V8 land yacht- The complete Street series: eight career races, ending against a proper sports car- Quick race, garage and workshop, real aftermarket parts- Time trial against your own ghost- Online leaderboard: your time against everyone else'sAnd most importantly: the full physics, nothing softened. Burnout, launch, shift window, tire tempera","occurred_at":nu